  <!-- TODO(Duncan): hours are copied from the old Hours page at crawl time (fall and winter hours). The old page also listed 2025 holiday closures (Thanksgiving, Christmas), which are not repeated here; add current closures. -->
  <h2>Open play and ropes course</h2>
  <p>Fall and winter hours: Monday–Thursday 10AM–7PM, Friday 10AM–6PM, Saturday and Sunday 9:30AM–5:00PM.</p>

  <h2>Pickleball hours</h2>
  <p>
    Monday–Thursday 9:00 am–3 pm and 5:30 pm–7 pm, Friday 9:00 AM–6:00 PM, Saturday 9:30 am–1 pm, Sunday 9:30 am–1 pm.
    Monday through Friday times are by appointment only: call or email us to reserve. Saturday and Sunday court times are
    first come first serve and cannot be reserved in advance, because other activities and events, such as birthday
    parties, may occupy the court.
  </p>

  <h2>Fitness hours</h2>
  <ul class="bullets">
    <li>Monday: Kickboxing at 5:45 am, 7:00 am, 12:15 pm, 6:15 pm</li>
    <li>Tuesday: SGX at 12:15 pm</li>
    <li>Wednesday: Kickboxing at 5:45 am, 7:00 am, 12:15 pm, 6:15 pm</li>
    <li>Thursday: SGX at 12:15 pm</li>
    <li>Friday: Kickboxing at 5:45 am, 7:00 am, 12:15 pm, 6:15 pm</li>
    <li>Saturday: Kickboxing at 9 am</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Camp hours</h2>
  <p>
    Monday–Friday 9 am–3 pm; closed Saturday and Sunday. Pre-camp starts at 7:30 am and post-camp runs 3 pm–6 pm,
    Monday–Friday. Pre-camp runs 7:30 am–9:00 am (per the Camps for Kids registration listing).
  </p>

  <h2>Childcare</h2>
  <p>
    Full-time infant &amp; toddler care and preschool with extended care are Monday through Friday, 7:30 am to 6:00 pm.
    See <a href="/infant-toddler-care">infant &amp; toddler care</a>, <a href="/preschool">preschool</a> and
    <a href="/after-school-care">before &amp; after school care</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Team building hours</h2>
  <p>By appointment only. Please call <a href={NAP.phoneTel}>{NAP.phoneDisplay}</a> for more information.</p>
